---
// One owner per alert: the first claim in the thread wins.
---

<section class="shot" data-shot="team">
  <div class="cam team">
    <div class="team-copy">
      <h2 class="hl-m">One owner per alert. <span class="dim">Across the team.</span></h2>
      <p class="sub">The first claim in the thread wins. No alert gets two agents.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="thread">
      <div class="slack-msg" data-tm>
        <span class="avatar bot">M</span>
        <div><p><b>Monitor</b> <span class="faint mono">#alert-api · 10:02</span></p><p>5xx rate 3.1% on /v4/orders over 5 minutes</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="slack-msg reply" data-tm>
        <span class="avatar maya">M</span>
        <div><p><b>Maya</b> <span class="faint">via Bridgetown · 10:02</span></p><p>🤖 Investigating with Bridgetown…</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="slack-msg reply late" data-tm data-late>
        <span class="avatar">A</span>
        <div><p><b>Alex</b> <span class="faint">via Bridgetown · 10:02</span></p><p>🤖 Investigating with Bridgetown…</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="withdrawn mono" data-withdrawn>Later claim withdrawn · no second agent</p>
      <div class="yours-notch" data-tm>
        <span class="faint">In your notch</span>
        <span class="pill-dark"><i class="dot dot-blue live"></i> Maya’s agent is on it</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .avatar.bot {
    background: var(--hi);
    color: #000;
  }

  .avatar.maya {
    background: oklch(0.5 0.1 160);
  }

  .team {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 760px 820px;
    gap: 120px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .thread {
    padding: 44px;
    font-size: 26px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: var(--card);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--hair);
  }

  .reply {
    margin-left: 70px;
  }

  .withdrawn {
    margin: 12px 0 0 140px;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--lo);
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .yours-notch {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 34px;
    padding-top: 26px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .pill-dark {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #000;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--hair-strong);
    color: var(--hi);
    font-size: 21px;
  }
</style>
